!320!Optional interpolation for this second HP bar. Off keeps direct native SetValue updates.
!96!Spell minimum cost (out of combat)
!320!Uses the learned spell's minimum cost for the selected bar. Updates outside combat after spell or talent changes and after combat. Temporary cost changes during combat are not tracked. Unavailable costs hide the mark.
