!96!Castbar fill direction
!320!Which way the bar grows during a cast, on every castbar. Channels drain the other way unless Always use fill direction for all casts is on.
!96!GCD bar: show spell name + icon
!320!Writes the instant spell's name on the GCD bar and shows its icon. Off leaves the spell text blank.
